license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Thermo Credit separates credit scale from borrower composition and publishes
  experimental regional diagnostics as a reproducible research system. The
  strongest current result is a Japanese borrower-composition measure built
  from Bank of Japan sectoral loan stocks.
keywords:
  - endogenous credit
  - borrower composition
  - sectoral lending
  - macro-financial diagnostics
  - reproducible research
